            "review_title": "Review at Dem Trang Cafe",
            "review_text": "longsaha\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam143 contributions\n0\nNice and quite coffee shop\nJul 2015\nDem Trang is small has very good decoration inside. It stays in CBD street but very quite. Music is nice. Besides coffee and beverage, there are several dishes which I really like such as Bún Chả Cá (fish cake noodle soup), Bún Thịt Nướng (grilled pork noodle), Cơm Hoàng Bào (stir-fried rice with seafood and chicken eggs)... Price is reasonable, which is about 30k for a coffee. and 35k-55k for a dish.\nRead more\nWritten July 16, 2015",
