            "review_title": "Review at Dem Trang Cafe",
            "review_text": "Jeff-Reviews\nSouth coast, UK11 contributions\n0\nPossibly the most chilled out cafe around in one of the quietest streets in HCMC.\nApr 2015 • Couples\nUltimately I felt compelled to unhide this hidden gem of a cafe to westerners. A small space that's been perfectly adorned and on all visits was nicely chilled out. Drinks only I think, the menu is in Vietnamesse only as perhaps they'd not planned on attracting westerners. But if your looking for somewhere to cool down, chill out and slow down from the pace of HCMC this place is perfect and the iced tea is excellent. Reasonable price range around 38k Dong for an ice tea. So not cheap cheap, but certainly not expensive for the lovely experiance of this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten April 18, 2015",
